  "description": "Fully-offline, open-weights speech-to-text for the Voxa pipeline using Mistral's Voxtral-Mini-4B-Realtime (Apache-2.0), served locally by vLLM over its realtime WebSocket API. Implements the streaming ISpeechToTextEngine — pair with the generic SpeechToTextProcessor from Voxa.Speech.Abstractions. Heavy tier (VLS-009): needs a GPU (>= 16 GB) and a vLLM server you run or let Voxa launch.",
